<title>USA: Citizens Corp Q4 net shr rises.</title>
<headline>Citizens Corp Q4 net shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>WORCESTER, Mass. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.63		    $0.51</p>
<p> Net		 22,400		   18,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  35,300		   36,000</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $2.37		    $2.02</p>
<p> Net		 84,100		   74,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  35,500		   36,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 includes $0.5 million after-tax net realized investment gains and $0.7 million after tax serverance charge. Q4 1995 includes $0.2 million after tax net realized investment losses. FY96 includes $9.7 million after tax net realized gains and $0.7 million after tax severance charge, while FY95 included $2.4 million after tax net realized gains.</p>
